{"step_index":584,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T18:37:54Z","thinking":"**Documenting the Walkthrough**\n\nI'm now generating the `walkthrough.md` file. It's designed to be a comprehensive guide for users. The aim is to fully document the architecture rewrite process. It will cover running, testing, and building the new native C# project. I've also verified the path for the artifact is the correct location.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Walkthrough document summarizing the complete C# native (.NET 8) rewrite of the Spectra application. Details architecture, modules, Native WebView2 bridge, and build instructions.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# 🚀 Walkthrough — Reescrita do Spectra em C# Nativo (.NET 8)\\n\\nConcluímos a reescrita completa e estruturação de toda a lógica do **Spectra** para **C# Nativo (.NET 8 / WPF + WebView2 Host)**.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🏗️ O que foi Desenvolvido\\n\\n### 1. Plataforma & Win32 (`src-csharp/Platform/`)\\n* **`NativeMethods.cs`:** Declarações P/Invoke nativas de alto desempenho para `user32.dll` e `dwmapi.dll`.\\n* **`WindowManager.cs`:** \\n  * Exclusão de gravação de tela com `WDA_EXCLUDEFROMCAPTURE` (`0x11` / `0x02`).\\n  * Modo Fantasma (Click-Through) via `WS_EX_TRANSPARENT`.\\n  * Transparência por camadas via `WS_EX_LAYERED` e `SetLayeredWindowAttributes` (40%, 70%, 100%).\\n  * Ocultação da barra de tarefas via `WS_EX_TOOLWINDOW`.\\n  * Movimentação de precisão sem roubo de foco (`SW_SHOWNOACTIVATE`).\\n* **`HotkeyManager.cs`:** Registro de todos os atalhos de teclado do sistema (`Alt+Z`, `Alt+X`, `Alt+S`, `Alt+P`, `Alt+1/2/3`, `Alt+Q/W/E`, `Alt+M`, `Alt+O`, `Alt+I/J/Left/Right`).\\n* **`ScreenShareMonitor.cs`:** Varredura em background para ocultar banners de compartilhamento do Teams/Zoom.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 2. Configuração & Serviços de Rede/IA (`src-csharp/Config/` & `src-csharp/Services/`)\\n* **`Settings.cs` & `ProviderConfig.cs`:** Leitura e persistência direta do `.env` e `ai_providers.json`.\\n* **`AudioService.cs`:** Captura nativa de microfone em buffer PCM (16kHz, 16-bit, Mono) otimizado para Deepgram via `NAudio`.\\n* **`DeepgramClient.cs`:** Conexão assíncrona streaming WebSocket com Deepgram Nova-2 (`wss://api.deepgram.com/v1/listen`), diarization e transcrição em tempo real.\\n* **`MultiLlmManager.cs`:** Motor de inferência multi-provedor (Cerebras, Groq, Gemini, OpenRouter) com streaming SSE (`Server-Sent Events`), chaveamento automático round-robin de API keys e failover de erros.\\n* **`VisionService.cs`:** Captura silenciosa de tela via GDI+ (`Graphics.CopyFromScreen`) e análise multimodal com fila de até 4 screenshots.\\n* **`ContextManager.cs`:** Injeção de perfil do candidato, his\n<truncated 1723 bytes>","Description":"\"Walkthrough of native C# (.NET 8) rewrite of Spectra\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Arthur Henrique\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\bbca0f09-2535-4f26-97c1-b43b75148a4f\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Creating walkthrough.md artifact\"","toolSummary":"\"Create walkthrough.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
